<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sundstrand Corp raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sundstrand Corp raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securites said it raised Sundstrand Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- raised the 1997 earnings per share estimate to $2.75 a share from $2.60 a share.</p>
<p>-- cited Sundstrand's forecast for a 20-25 percent revenue gain in aerospace in 19997.</p>
<p>-- expects Sundstrand can post 20 percent earnings per share growth over the &quot;next couple of years.&quot;</p>
<p>-- set a 12- month price target of $55 a share.</p>
<p>-- Sundstrand gained two to 44-1/2 in midday exchange trade.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
